        <name>builtInExtensions</name>
        <qualifiedname>terminal::LinkDetector::builtInExtensions</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Returns the built-in set of known file extensions. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The set is constructed once on first call (static local) and is never modified after initialisation. Extensions are stored in lowercase with a leading dot (e.g. <computeroutput>".cpp"</computeroutput>).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>Const reference to the static extension set. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
