    <briefdescription>
<para>Classifies a text token as a <ref refid="classURL" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">URL</ref>, a file path with a known extension, or neither. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All methods are static — the class is not instantiated. The built-in extension set is constructed once on first use (static local) and reused for every subsequent call.</para>
